| [DaisyUI](https://daisyui.com/) | 5.8.0 |
| [@tailwindcss/browser](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/installation/play-cdn) | 4.3.5 |
| [Alpine.js](https://alpinejs.dev/) | 3.17.5 |
